sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Papa (Elder mode)
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API (WS /voice)
  participant T as Muse Voice Transcribe
  participant G as Agent orchestrator
  participant M as Muse Spark 1.3
  participant E as Safety engine
  participant S as TTS service
  P->>W: Hold the big mic button and speak
  W->>A: Audio chunks
  A->>T: PCM 16 kHz, ENDPOINTING, language hints
  T-->>A: Final transcript
  A->>G: Message from device (paired patient)
  G->>M: Care plan fields + question + tools
  M-->>G: Tool call or answer
  alt "Ask first" tool (message the doctor, share a card)
    G->>E: Permission gate
    E-->>G: Stored as awaiting_approval, family notified
  else Automatic tool
    G->>E: Run tool (read plan, set reminder)
  end
  G->>E: Output guard on the reply
  E-->>G: pass (source attached) or blocked
  G->>S: Reply text, slow pace
  S-->>W: Audio
  W-->>P: Spoken answer, large text, "Repeat that" button
  Note over G,E: Medicine names are read back and matched against the written prescription
